    "https://www.pacificu.edu/directory/finance-administration/human-resources/jobs-pacific": {
      "title": "Main navigation",
      "description": "Careers at Pacific University | Pacific University Skip to main content Home Search Main navigation Academics Admissions Life at Pacific About Secondary menu Search Main menu (Mobile) Academics Admissions Life at Pacific About Quick links Calendar Athletics Libraries Office Directory Give Information for ... Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Community In this section ... Human Resources Jobs at Pacific New Employees Student Employment Benefits Expand menu Benefits Medical, Dental & Vision Expand menu Medical, Dental & Vision Regence BCBS Medical Kaiser Permanente The Standard Dental Willamette Dental Group Regence Dental Vision COBRA Nonstop Health Flexible Spending Accounts Open Enrollment Insurance Disability Insurance Workers' Compensation Travel Insurance Employee Wellness Expand menu Employee Wellness Employee Assistance Program Enlight App Labyrinth Smoke-Free Workplace Ergonomics ADA Accommodations Time Off and Leaves Expand menu Time Off and Leaves Medical Short Term Disability Sick Leave Other Types of Leave Retirement Plan Expand menu Retirement Plan Retirement Plan Committee Tuition Remission, Exchange & Assistance Life@Pacific Expand menu Life@Pacific Boxer Card Campus Emergency Campus Safety Resources Discounts & Perks Family Resources Get Involved Life & Career Events Expand menu Life & Career Events Growing Your Family Getting Married or Divorced Payroll Expand menu Payroll Moving Expenses Holiday Schedule Inclement Weather Paycom Expand menu Paycom Paycom Guides and Forms Policies Forms Supervisor Resources Expand menu Supervisor Resources My Performance Professional Development 1099 Independent Contractor Access Temporary Staffing & Recruitment Guide Identity Theft Resources Human Resources Team Breadcrumb Office Directory Finance & Administration Human Resources Careers At Pacific University Careers at Pacific University Paragraphs Pacific University achieves excellence and distinction by investing in exceptional people to think, care, create, and pursue justice in our world. We embrace discovery in a close nurturing environment that leads to genuine transformation. Our community is diverse, sustainable, and dedicated to discovery and excellence in teaching, scholarship and practice. At Pacific University we thrive in an extraordinary environment, surrounded by the beauty of the great Pacific Northwest, with campus locations in Forest Grove and Hillsboro . We humbly acknowledge and thank the original caretakers of the lands on which we live, work, teach, acquire and share knowledge. For qualifying employees, our benefits include generous paid time off for vacation, holidays (including winter break) and sick leave. We offer medical coverage with alternative care (in-network services covered at 100% after payroll deduction), comprehensive dental, vision plans, 6% contribution to retirement after one year of service with no match required, free mental health appointments, and tuition remission for employees and their dependents. We cover employer paid life, short term disability, and long term disability insurance. On campus benefits include free access to our sports facility and library, with discounts on campus food, bookstore purchases, clinic services, and gear rentals through our outdoor program (kayaks, snow shoes, bikes and more). Candidates from diverse backgrounds are encouraged to apply. Studies have shown that candidates that are female and/or BIPOC are less likely to apply for jobs unless they meet all of the qualifications they find in the job description. We are seeking the best candidate for the job, and that candidate may be a person who comes from a less traditional background. We encourage you to apply even if you don't meet every minimum qualification described or are unsure if your experience could be considered related experience. Current Open Positions FACULTY/STAFF STUDENT WORKERS Notice of Nondiscrimination Policy It is the policy of Pacific University not to discriminate on the basis of race, color, national or ethnic origin, ancestry, age, religion or religious creed, disability, sex or gender, gender identity and/or expression, sexual orientation, military, veteran or Vietnam Era status, or any other protected classification recognized by applicable law, in admission, access to, or treatment in employment, educational programs or activities as required by Title IX of the Education Amendments of 1972, section 504 of the Rehabilitation Act of 1973, Title VII of the Civil Rights Act of 1964, the Age Discrimination Act, the Americans with Disabilities Act of 1990, or any other applicable state or federal law, or city ordinance. Questions or complaints may be directed to the Vice President for Academic Affairs, 2043 College Way, Forest Grove, OR 97116 , provost@pacificu.edu . Footer Menu Support at Pacific Emergency Information Tech Support Newsroom Careers at Pacific Policies & Forms Office Directory Facebook Instagram Youtube Tiktok Linkedin home link 2043 College Way Forest Grove, OR 97116 503-352-6151 Online Privacy Digital Accessibility Non-Discrimination Copyright © Pacific University all rights reserved"
    },
